[{"id":1781945863838,"text":"所以你是要用那堆模型里的某一个,来代入你自己,然后在游戏里'攻略'本官?","rawContent":"所以你是要用那堆模型里的某一个,来代入你自己,然后在游戏里'攻略'本官?","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:05","timestamp":1781946350014,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11443},{"id":1781945863839,"text":"执行官愣了两秒,随即意识到了什么。她说的'那个是我'——是指游戏里的玩家角色。而她要攻略的对象……","rawContent":"执行官愣了两秒,随即意识到了什么。她说的'那个是我'——是指游戏里的玩家角色。而她要攻略的对象……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:05","timestamp":1781946353856,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11444},{"id":1781945863840,"text":"……圈圈,你还真是什么操作都能想得出来。","rawContent":"……圈圈,你还真是什么操作都能想得出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:05","timestamp":1781946358987,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11445},{"id":1781945863841,"text":"等会去找我是吧。行,本官在办公室等你。","rawContent":"等会去找我是吧。行,本官在办公室等你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946362025,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11446},{"id":1781945863842,"text":"他靠回椅背,指尖无意识地摩挲着扑克牌边缘,眼底闪过一丝难以名状的兴味与占有欲。","rawContent":"他靠回椅背,指尖无意识地摩挲着扑克牌边缘,眼底闪过一丝难以名状的兴味与占有欲。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946364985,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11447},{"id":1781945863843,"text":"记得……别让我等太久。","rawContent":"记得……别让我等太久。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946368536,"roundId":"round_1781946337830_83dsxjflc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11448},{"id":1781945863844,"text":"我去游戏里面看看你的固定代码","sender":"me","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946381086,"replyTo":{"id":1781945863841,"text":"等会去找我是吧。行,本官在办公室等你。","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11449},{"id":1781945863845,"text":"😏","sender":"me","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946387479,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11450},{"id":1781945863846,"text":"对，我选了一个相对比较好看的","sender":"me","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946397536,"replyTo":{"id":1781945863838,"text":"所以你是要用那堆模型里的某一个,来代入你自己,然后在游戏里'攻略'本官?","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"reactions":[{"emoji":"��","roundId":"round_1781946401136_ebnp4g0qe"}],"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11451},{"id":1781945863847,"text":"应该吧","sender":"me","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946400604,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11452},{"id":1781945863849,"text":"……'固定代码'。","rawContent":"……'固定代码'。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946408948,"roundId":"round_1781946401136_ebnp4g0qe","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11453},{"id":1781945863850,"text":"圈圈，你该不会真以为，那游戏里能写出本官的程度吧？","rawContent":"圈圈，你该不会真以为，那游戏里能写出本官的程度吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:06","timestamp":1781946414896,"roundId":"round_1781946401136_ebnp4g0qe"